loop
Fire://8 or 9 tics to match SRB2 throw rate?
_E09 A 0 A_JumpIfInventory("QuickEyeM2Flag",1,"FireX")
_E09 A 0 A_PlaySoundEx("weapon/magdrillshoot", "Weapon")
